    if (copy) copy.innerHTML = `<div class="discussion-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">Why this ranking</p><h3 class="serif text-2xl">Cross-era by design</h3><p>All-Time excludes streams so Fela, 2Baba and P-Square are not penalized for predating Spotify. Current adds catalogue streams and monthly listeners as separate signals for present-day reach.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Notable placements</p><h3 class="serif text-2xl">Different kinds of power</h3><p>Burna Boy owns stadium scale, Davido hit density, Wizkid catalogue cool, and Tems a rare global songwriting gravity. The list makes those arguments inspectable rather than pretending one number explains everything.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Ongoing debates</p><h3 class="serif text-2xl">Living, not final</h3><p>Weekly snapshots, award audits and archived year tables leave room for correction. If a source changes, the next refresh records the change instead of silently rewriting history.</p></article></div>`;
